<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Sixth Sense</ansi> mutation

Something beyond your normal senses awakens — a preternatural
awareness of danger. You react to threats before you consciously
perceive them, but the constant vigilance frays your composure.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Greatly improved dodge — you begin evading attacks before you
  consciously register them

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Significantly reduced willpower — the constant stream of
  preternatural warnings exhausts your mental composure

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Heightened Senses

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
